    <bpmn:serviceTask id="Activity_0br7dve" name="getInvolved" zeebe:modelerTemplate="org.camunda.connector.involveduser.InvolvedUserFunction" zeebe:modelerTemplateIcon="data:image/png;base64,">
      <bpmn:extensionElements>
        <zeebe:taskDefinition type="c-involveduser-function" />
        <zeebe:ioMapping>
          <zeebe:input target="filterTask" />
          <zeebe:input source="true" target="failIfError" />
